title: >-
  stream-recoverability: Recoverability Frontiers and Multisource
  Information Compensation for Stream Temperature Under Multiscale
  Monitoring Outages
abstract: >-
  Software for testing when daily stream observations remain
  recoverable under structured monitoring outages. The case study
  uses three Upper Jinsha River stations (Batang, Shigu, Panzhihua).
  This citation is for the software. Study data remain restricted;
  see DATA_RIGHTS.md.
